        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through having product leaders who are physicians, designers, and engineers familiar with healthcare services, and an extended team of medical professionals in our advisory committees, we are able to build solutions that enable our members to better care for their patients and act as an extension of their practice.",
