        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have designed each of these services with a broad range of customized, physician-first features specific to our platform, such as our ‘call nudge’ reminding a patient of a visit, ‘straight to voicemail’ enabling physicians to choose not to disturb patients after-hours, and the flexibility to switch between voice and video at will, among others.",
