        "accession_number": "0001516513-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we will continue to grow our number of physician members, we are under-penetrated among other types of medical professionals, such as nurse practitioners and physician assistants, and have an opportunity to expand our offering to physical therapists, dentists, psychologists, and many other professions.",
